# Build output — must never enter the context. Stale obj/project.assets.json
# carries host-absolute paths and can cause restore to be skipped entirely.
**/bin/
**/obj/
**/out/

# IDE / tooling
**/.vs/
**/.idea/
**/.claude/
**/*.user
**/*.DotSettings.user

# Test artefacts
**/TestResults/

# Docker itself
**/Dockerfile*
**/.dockerignore
